---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---
<PageLayout
  title="Suggest a Studio | Berlin Studio Map"
  description="Help me keep Berlin Studio Map complete and accurate."
  canonical="https://berlinstudiomaps.com/suggest/"
>
<div class="container">
  <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / Suggest a Studio</div>
  <h1>Suggest a Studio</h1>
  <p>Know a photography studio in Berlin that isn't on my map? I'd love to add it.</p>
  <p>Email me at <a href="mailto:hello@berlinstudiomaps.com?subject=Studio Suggestion">hello@berlinstudiomaps.com</a> with the studio name and website, and I'll get it added.</p>
  <p>If you're a studio owner and your listing has incorrect information, please email me with corrections and I'll update it promptly.</p>
</div>
</PageLayout>
